  triage:description "Sprint AX.2 Required validation: in crates/atm-core/tests/nudge_mode.rs, a Herdr member, atm send then atm queue, asserting the emitted prompt text for each equals the expected Delivery / Queue default render. At 4f77d2fff the AX.2 diff against origin/feature/ax1-queue-template-class does not touch nudge_mode.rs at all; the only Herdr reference is tmux_and_herdr_delivery_families_share_the_nudge_kind_table, which loops over string labels against the backend-independent pure function. Same underlying gap as AX.1's AX1-QA2-001 (cipher's AX.1 fix pass adds the Herdr-backed member); this record covers the AX.2-specific prompt-text assertions on the Herdr sink for send and queue, which gate AX.2 on their own. Reported by req-qa, confirmed by quality-mgr on PR #1186 QA-1." ;
